:line047","text":"咸寧四年卒，詔曰：「欽履道清正，執德貞素。文武之稱，著于方夏。入躋機衡，惟允庶事。肆勤內外，有匪躬之節。不幸薨沒，朕甚悼之。其贈衛將軍、開府儀同三司，賜秘器、朝服一具、衣一襲、布五十匹、錢三十萬。」諡曰元。又以欽忠清高潔，不營產業，身沒之後，家無所庇，特賜錢五十萬，為立第舍。復下詔曰：「故司空王基、衛將軍盧欽、領典軍將軍楊囂，並素清貧，身沒之後，居無私積。頃者饑饉，聞其家大匱，其各賜穀三百斛。」欽曆宰州郡，不尚功名，唯以平理為務。祿俸散之親故，不營貲產。動循禮典，妻亡，制廬杖，終喪居外。所著詩賦論難數十篇，名曰《小道》。子浮嗣。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line047:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"欽","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line047:m0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"欽","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line047:m0147","start":147,"end":149,"surface":"王基","kind":"person","person_id":"7f4_2d4_c15","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line047:m0153","start":153,"end":155,"surface":"盧欽","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line047:m0161","start":161,"end":163,"surface":"楊囂","kind":"person","person_id":"0c1_b9d_9c2_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line047:m0199","start":199,"end":200,"surface":"欽","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line047:m0264","start":264,"end":265,"surface":"浮","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":47,"last_line":47,"revision_id":1775345},"source_quote":{"witness":"j44","quote":"　　{{YL|咸寧四年}}卒，詔曰：「欽履道清正，執德貞素。文武之稱，著于方夏。入躋機衡，惟允庶事。肆勤內外，有匪躬之節。不幸薨沒，朕甚悼之。其贈衛將軍、開府儀同三司，賜秘器、朝服一具、衣一襲、布五十匹、錢三十萬。」諡曰元。又以欽忠清高潔，不營產業，身沒之後，家無所庇，特賜錢五十萬，為立第舍。復下詔曰：「故司空王基、衛將軍盧欽、領典軍將軍楊囂，並素清貧，身沒之後，居無私積。頃者饑饉，聞其家大匱，其各賜穀三百斛。」欽曆宰州郡，不尚功名，唯以平理為務。祿俸散之親故，不營貲產。動循禮典，妻亡，制廬杖，終喪居外。所著詩賦論難數十篇，名曰《小道》。子浮嗣。","raw_start":3649,"raw_end":3925,"raw_line":47},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luqin"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luqin","source":{"title":"晉書卷四十四","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1775345","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1775345","revision_id":1775345,"accessed_on":"2026-11-21","extent":"固定數位題「盧欽」題下全文。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代本文及維基文庫數位轉錄。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"維基文庫固定修訂1775345","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-1775345-raw.wikitext","wikitext_sha256":"09742e651b479fea881fd24c7734451de2b78b9f0410adda36ba210c31a0b5c8","raw_file_sha256":"09742e651b479fea881fd24c7734451de2b78b9f0410adda36ba210c31a0b5c8","collation_witnesses":["source-evidence/jin044-luqin-lufu-luting/reading.json"]}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical","civil_year_label_field":"chinese_civil_year","civil_year_label_coverage":"partial","regnal_year_crosses_ce_year_is_gregorian_projection":true}}
